# Build context for the backend service images (apps/chat, apps/notifications, apps/web3).
# The Next.js app (apps/web) deploys to Vercel and is never containerized, but its
# package.json must stay in context so `npm ci` can resolve the workspace graph.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
apps/web/src/generated
apps/web/src/lib/generated
apps/web/public
.git
.github
**/*.log

# Never ship env files into an image — secrets come from the platform.
**/.env
**/.env.*

DEPLOYMENT_PLAN.md
docker
docker-compose.yml
